              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ka ce kec opoto i lobo, onyo two edeke, onyo ceŋ otwo kai oko, onyo oner oko, onyo bonyo, onyo kit kudi moro ocele en ame ocamo; onyo ka okwor oero lweny i kom joni, te gurogi oko i bomagi, onyo ka two moro ocele ame opoto i akinagi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tim ber iwiny kwacgi. Ka ce ŋattoro keken i akina joni Icrael ame cunye ocwer obino ocwalo kwaccere baŋi, kun nyime one no ot man, onyo jo Icrael luŋ ocwalo kwacgi baŋi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
