          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tim ber iwiny kwacgi. Winy kwacgi i kabedoni ame tye malo i polo timgi kica, ite timo gin ame ineno ni porre pire on yo pirgi i kom gin ame gin okwao. Yin keni gire ineo gin ame tye i cuny dano acel acel; pi mannono, yin timmi ŋat acel acel gin ame ineno ni porre pire, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "me jo Icrael bed kede lworo i komi kare luŋ ame gin tye i lobo ame yin rik imio baŋ kwarigi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.31",
