              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aman doŋ ba, Ama Obaŋa, cik waŋi dok iter daŋ yiti i kwac luŋ ame obino kwayo i kabedo man.",
          "type": "text",
